sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Cormas simulation
    participant M as FEBModel
    participant H as Households (random order)
    participant O as Outlets (random order)
    participant P as Probes
    S->>M: step
    M->>M: delete yesterday's trip legs<br/>(they leave their FEBTrip)
    loop each household
        M->>H: step
        Note over H: eat (meals recorded → missing meals, diet diversity)<br/>shop: one FEBTripLeg per walk, added to its FEBTrip<br/>(time and money recorded → shopping minutes, budget share)
    end
    M->>M: outletStockouts := countStockouts<br/>(after shopping, before restocking)
    loop each outlet
        M->>O: step
        Note over O: restock, age food, record end of day
    end
    S->>P: read probes
    Note over P: missing meals · diet diversity · outlet stockouts<br/>minutes to the first outlet · outlets visited (trip legs)<br/>shopping minutes · share of budget spent
